OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FDry tonight,
OL,6,Fwith clear spells likely, allowing
OL,7,Fanother cold night with a widespread
OL,8,Ffrost developing, potentially severe
OL,9,Fin prone spots. Perhaps one or two
OL,10,Ffreezing fog patches forming.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSaturday:FAnother cold feeling day,
OL,13,Fwith a strengthening breeze later.
OL,14,FDry, however, with some cloud but
OL,15,Fplenty of sunny spells.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
