OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:
OL,6,FUnsettled with rain or showers and
OL,7,Fstronger winds, mixed with some drier
OL,8,Fand brighter intervals. Milder Sunday,
OL,9,Fbut cooler Monday into Tuesday with a
OL,10,Frisk of snow on higher ground.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
